{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_06_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_06",
  "title": "骷髅之舞",
  "storyCode": "LE-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2e7ca67aad6d85c803c4faa23f6269feaa1ac68cf63f02a6bbf3516d85d1e968",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两人在幽暗而宽阔的下水道里前行。\n水声聒噪，却比纯粹的寂静更让人觉得阴气森森。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "别往前走了，这里右拐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你很熟啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "我当然熟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "密探的基本功？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "基本中的基本。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "那你在夕照区已经干了很多年了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "想套近乎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "只是好奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "这是保密事项。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "没劲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "怎么不走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "那边有什么东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "别想靠这种老掉牙的把戏脱身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不是——你看那边，有东西在动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "别格勒用手中的武器抵住乌提卡伯爵的后心，然后朝伯爵手指的方向看去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "只是源石虫而已。源石虫你都没见过？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "真的......只是源石虫吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "堂堂乌提卡伯爵，居然被源石虫吓得走不动路，我也算是长见识了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我还是觉得有点不对劲......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "别傻了，赶紧走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......好，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "等等，等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "这个源石虫的数量......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "......这绝对不正常！会出大事的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "跑起来！快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你干什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "已经要来不及了！赶快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "别格勒紧紧抓着黑键的手腕，两人在下水道里飞跑起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "呼、呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你脑子里是装了下水道的地图吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "有时间跟我阴阳怪气，还不如多喘几口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "不是阴、阴阳怪气，我是真觉得每条岔路长得都一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "休息好了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "才——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "接着跑！跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "（喘息声）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我......不行了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "正好，我们也找到了该找的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "晚上好，拉赫曼先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "晚上好，别格勒店长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "店长？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "唉，您自己什么都不知道，又什么都想掺和一脚，真是麻烦死了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "您说是吧，别格勒店长？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "同意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "但你才是现在最大的麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "这里的源石虫显然受到了你的刺激，正在往地面上涌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "你我都知道，下水道里的源石虫会散发有毒的臭气，你在做的事情对夕照区的感染者来说无异于一场毒气袭击。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "毒气袭击？可我们两个不是好好的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "这种气体对感染者的效果比对你强多了，乌提卡伯爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "这么说，车尔尼、芙蓉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "白垩也......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "很好，你已经明白情况了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "拉赫曼，马上安抚这些源石虫，让它们恢复原状，否则我有权直接将你击毙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "不可能了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "一个人可以轻轻松松引发火灾，但你就算把刀架在他脖子上，也不可能让他独自把大火扑灭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "这样做对你们有什么好处？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "好处？您连这点事都不明白吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "别跟我打哑谜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "“虫自阴暗中涌出，肆意喷吐毁灭的前奏。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "还需要我一个词一个词地帮您解释吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "......所以说，让那个预言成真，对你们有什么好处？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉赫曼",
      "text": "这就不劳您费心了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "你想干什么？灭口？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "只是击昏他，我亲爱的眼神不好的密探先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你有控制源石虫的办法吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "如果我有，就不用跟他废话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "那我们赶紧走，晚了就怕来不及了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "（锐利的眼神）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "人不可貌相啊，乌提卡伯爵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "行，我去把他背起来，你跟着我跑出去——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "等等，那个是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "顺着别格勒的视线，黑键也看到了。\n拉赫曼倒下的地方，下水道的墙壁上，有什么银色的东西正闪着光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "是钥匙孔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "里面也许是驱动源石虫的什么装置！我来把门轰开——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "先让我试试能不能把锁撬开吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "万一你轰坏了什么重要的东西，那就糟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "能打开吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "这锁很难开，但还难不倒我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "那你能不能趁开锁时行行好，告诉我，预言的内容究竟是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "你没听过？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "......算了，反正已经传开了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "越过高高的山岗，恶魔踏入黄昏的中央。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "血中的恶疾隐伏，款款招来蔓延的死亡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "虫自阴暗中涌出，肆意喷吐毁灭的前奏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "终曲的合奏消散，灾祸带走最后的阳光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......合奏......灾祸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "说实话，我到现在都很好奇最后一句是什么意思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "前面都已经很明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "第一句是罗德岛的芙蓉来到夕照区，第二句是假愈现象蔓延......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "你连这个都知道？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "你以为密探的工作是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "现在第三句也明白了，差的就只有最后一句——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "开了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "这是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "实验室？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "哦，是你啊。主持工作辛苦你了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礼貌的感染者",
      "text": "车尔尼先生，外面现在已经乱成一锅粥了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礼貌的感染者",
      "text": "下水道里冒出了一波又一波散发臭气的源石虫，好多人中了毒，街上已经全乱套了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礼貌的感染者",
      "text": "好多人都把这当成预言的一部分，现在夕照区已经人心惶惶了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "怎么会有这种事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "人心惶惶先不论，那些被熏倒的人情况怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礼貌的感染者",
      "text": "不是很乐观......尤其是最近矿石病有好转的那些人，反应都很剧烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礼貌的感染者",
      "text": "我们已经在联系医院了，但那些医院的接线员一听说是夕照区的事，都不是很积极......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "不积极？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我这就出门去和那些医院交涉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礼貌的感染者",
      "text": "外面现在很危险，您还是打电话吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "如果你们打的电话他们不积极，我光是打打电话也不可能有什么用，这事必须得我本人出马。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礼貌的感染者",
      "text": "明天就是音乐会了，如果您也中了毒......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "要是因为这种莫名其妙的事件出现了伤亡，就算音乐会如期举行，还能有人全心全意享受音乐吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车尔尼",
      "text": "我不想事情发展到那一步，更不想假装什么都没发生，一边欺骗自己，一边强颜欢笑地弹奏哪怕一个和弦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "怎么这么多源石虫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神经质的感染者",
      "text": "好臭！这什么味道啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "我扶着你，咱们赶紧跑吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神经质的感染者",
      "text": "看来......预言是真的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "该死的虫子，别过来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "克劳泽，克劳泽！站起来——咳、咳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "救命！来人啊，谁来救救我们！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "大提琴声......源石虫往声音传来的方向去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "谢谢你，过路人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "克劳泽，起来，扶着我的肩膀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神经质的感染者",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的感染者",
      "text": "扶着我，我们快走吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白垩",
      "text": "（小声）不客气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "以白垩为中心，大提琴声沿着夕照区狭窄的街巷蔓延开去。\n琴声所到之处，源石虫纷纷调转方向。\n那些被包围的人们以为事情就此了结，喷吐毒雾的虫豸会在琴声的指引下回到阴暗的沟渠里。\n但他们错了。\n在他们看得到的地方，看不到的地方，源石虫都朝着白垩的方向涌去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "呼、呼、呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "终于......出来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "现在......怎么办，直接用法术炸翻这些虫子吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "——不对劲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "又怎么不对劲了，我亲爱的密探先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "源石虫在朝一个地方汇集——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "大提琴声......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "白垩，你在做什么？快停下——咳、咳咳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "别喊了，没用的，对你的呼吸系统也不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "帮我一把，让我过去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "说了别喊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "他不会因为你喊就停下，我也不会因为你不喊就袖手旁观。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我们两个合力打开一条通道，往白垩的方向去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "不行。我会往你的反方向行进。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "要回你的咖啡店？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "没错。我们合力在这里打开一个空缺，之后就分道扬镳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "回你的咖啡店，研究那些在实验室里发现的破纸，是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "谢天谢地，尘世之音的研究笔记可比源石虫毒气的受害者更令人感兴趣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "白垩的事是你自己惹出来的，你自己解决。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "再有，如果我发现那些研究笔记和计划书里有一笔是你写的，你就等着吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑键",
      "text": "我很期待。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "闲话到此为止。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "别格勒",
      "text": "我数到三，我们一起动手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
